Soundscape is MIT licensed: see LICENSE. Parts of the Swift package, in
swift/Sources/Soundscape/Render/, follow the design of these files of
Chromium. The band-limited oscillator, an LFO's included, and the path an
oscillator takes when an LFO drives its detune, follow:

  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/periodic_wave_handler.cc
  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/oscillator_handler.cc
  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/oscillator_handler.h
