  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/audio_scheduled_source_handler.cc
  third_party/blink/renderer/platform/audio/audio_utilities.cc

The filter, its coefficients, its two realizations and where its ring ends,
and how an LFO reaches a param through its gain, follows:

  third_party/blink/renderer/platform/audio/biquad.cc
  third_party/blink/renderer/platform/audio/biquad.h
  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/biquad_filter_handler.cc
  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/biquad_filter_handler.h
  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/biquad_filter_node.cc
  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/audio_handler.cc
  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/audio_handler.h
  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/audio_param_handler.cc
  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/gain_handler.cc

The math functions the filter calls, ported so that it computes what
Chromium computes on every platform, follow V8's fork of fdlibm as Chromium
carries it, built as Chromium builds it:

  third_party/fdlibm/ieee754.cc
  third_party/fdlibm/ieee754.h
  third_party/fdlibm/overflowing-math.h
  third_party/fdlibm/BUILD.gn
  build/config/compiler/BUILD.gn

