GitHub mirror, github.com/chromium/chromium. The Swift was written from
reading them, not copied, and is close enough to their design to carry their
notices, which follow: Chromium's own, which covers the files that carry no
other; the two that biquad.cc, biquad.h and biquad_filter_node.cc carry; and
